{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3f8c140a30e5083f","name":"Far Shot","source":{"id":"source:reference-3f8c140a30e5083f","title":"Far Shot","revision":24959,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:10:23Z","sha256":"e9b0855bdb2ead397dd743da13fc1611b51b08da328c26398737507416608b67","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24959","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Far%20Shot&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3f8c140a30e5083f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are better at shooting distant foes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When you use a ranged weapon against targets at Short, Medium, or Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," category is considered one less. In other words, you take no penalty on ranged attack rolls made at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", a -2 penalty on ranged attack rolls made against targets at Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", and a -5 penalty on ranged attack rolls made against targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," When making a ranged attack roll, a character takes a -2 penalty against targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", a -5 penalty against targets at Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", and a -10 penalty against targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This feat works normally with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},". However, if you are using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missiles or Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missiles_or_Torpedoes"}," and you miss with your attack roll, the projectile does not gain the benefit of this feat for the second attack roll.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Let's say I have a sniper with the Far Shot Feat who ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aims"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aims"}," before making a single attack with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon that has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},". Do any of these effects stack with one another?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Far Shot, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aiming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aiming"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},", and using an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon all stack, providing progressively better attacks against distant targets. I can see how the precise interaction might be a bit confusing, so here are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties (Point-Blank, Short, Medium, and Long) for each combination:\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Non-",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},"):"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["With no other modifiers: Point-Blank +0, Short -2, Medium -5, Long -10"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With Far Shot OR ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},": Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium -2, Long -5"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With Far Shot AND ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},": Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long -2"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapon (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sporting Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sporting_Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:71fc5e161a6b812a"},"):"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["With no other modifiers: Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium -5, Long -10"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With Far Shot OR ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},": Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long -5"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["With Far Shot AND ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},": Point-Blank +0, Short +0, Medium +0, Long +0"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Thus, if a trained sniper with the Far Shot Feat uses a good sniping weapon (anything with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," quality plus a mounted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Targeting Scope"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Targeting_Scope","referenceId":"reference:d75342116ec32b75"},") and takes the time to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"},", that sniper can attack a target at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," without taking a penalty on the attack roll.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
